OL,3,GNEWSADrink-driver hit road sign and
OL,4,Akilled himself and friend after night
OL,5,Aout
OL,6,
OL,7,FA drink-driver who hit a road sign and
OL,8,Fflipped his car killed himself and his
OL,9,Fbest friend, an inquest has heard.
OL,11,FAled Coleman, 23 from Fishguard, was
OL,12,Fdriving home on the A40 between
OL,13,FHaverfordwest and Fishguard in
OL,14,FPembrokeshire, after a night out on 14
OL,15,FSeptember 2025 at 03:15 BST.
OL,17,FHis friend Aled Bowen, 18, from Trecwn,
OL,18,Fwas in the passenger seat. Neither of
OL,19,Fthe men were wearing seatbelts.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
