OL,3,GNEWSADrink-driver hit road sign and
OL,4,Akilled himself and friend after night
OL,5,Aout
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Thursday, the hearing at
OL,8,FPembrokeshire County Hall was told the
OL,9,Fcar hit "a roadside sign and
OL,10,Foverturned" and "alcohol consumption
OL,11,Fand inappropriate speed were
OL,12,Fcontributing factors in the collision".
